<!-- Why: global styles for navbars. Static navbar (floating) is
     absolute overlay on hero, so the first section of the page has to start
     from the very top, otherwise a gap would be visible under the transparent strip.
     The sibling selector works because the header is rendered before <main>.-->
<style is:global>
	[data-site-header-static] ~ main > section.ui-section:first-child:not(.hero-section) {
		padding-top: 0;
	}
</style>
